        <div class="col-md-4"><div class="testi"><div class="mb-2 text-warning">★★★★★</div><p class="text-secondary">Paket 7 hari paling hemat, pas buat kerja remote seminggu.</p><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3"><div class="avatar">D</div><div><strong>Dimas</strong><br><small class="text-muted">Freelancer</small></div></div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
