            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#f2">Bagaimana cara memakai voucher?</button></h2>
              <div id="f2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAcc"><div class="accordion-body text-secondary">Sambungkan ke WiFi Panji, buka browser, lalu masukkan kode voucher di halaman login yang muncul.</div></div>
